{
  "name": "Daily ATS Hiring Signals Alert (25K+ Greenhouse, Lever, Ashby & SmartRecruiters)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Daily B2B Target-Account Hiring Signals (25K+ ATS Index)\n\n**How to set up (2 min):**\n1. Create an **HTTP Header Auth** credential: Header Name = `Authorization`, Value = `Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN>`.\n2. Edit `companies` (plain names auto-resolved across 25,700+ Greenhouse, Lever, Ashby & SmartRecruiters boards) and trigger `keywords` (`AI`, `Security`, `VP`).\n3. Connect Slack, verify `#hiring-signals`, and activate the weekday schedule.\n\nActor docs: https://apify.com/clearstack-data/career-site-jobs-search",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444001",
      "name": "Setup Guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 8 * * 1-5"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444002",
      "name": "Every Weekday at 08:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/clearstack-data~career-site-jobs-search/run-sync-get-dataset-items?maxTotalChargeUsd=0.25",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\"companies\":[\"Stripe\",\"OpenAI\",\"Anthropic\",\"Palantir\",\"Linear\",\"Datadog\",\"Notion\",\"Figma\"],\"keywords\":[\"AI\",\"Security\",\"VP\",\"Head of\"],\"remoteOnly\":false,\"maxJobsTotal\":50,\"onlyNewSinceLastRun\":true,\"monitorStateName\":\"target-accounts\"}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444003",
      "name": "Check New Target Account Openings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "const rows = $input.all().filter(i => i.json && (i.json.jobId || i.json.title));\nif (!rows.length) return [];\nconst lines = rows.slice(0, 15).map(i => {\n  const j = i.json;\n  return `- *${j.company}* [${j.ats}]: *${j.title}* (${j.location || 'Unspecified'}) -> ${j.applyUrl}`;\n});\nreturn [{ json: { text: (`*New Target Account Hiring Signals (${rows.length})*\\n` + lines.join('\\n')).slice(0, 2800) } }];"
      },
      "id": "44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444004",
      "name": "Format Hiring Signals Digest",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        740,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "#hiring-signals",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444005",
      "name": "Send to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        980,
        300
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every Weekday at 08:00": {
      "main": [
